tle><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/bitcoin-great-month-solana-soars-above-100/</link><description>除了比特币的卷土重来之外，投资者还找到了购买 Solana 的新理由。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1370827731-e1787856311287.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:49:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/bitcoin-great-month-solana-soars-above-100/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 首次进军物理人工智能领域，为科学家和制造商提供将设备变为现实的新方法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/anthropic-makes-first-move-into-physical-ai-with-universal-standard-for-scientists-manufacturing/</link><description>模型硬件标准 (MHS) 适用于任何 AI 模型，而不仅仅是 Claude，但目前只有少数公司可以访问研究预览。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1401717766-e1787851026926.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/anthropic-makes-first-move-into-physical-ai-with-universal-standard-for-scientists-manufacturing/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 禁止亲俄罗斯的 ChatGPT 帐户用于传播亲克里姆林宫的内容，包括使用真实研究人员姓名的以色列智囊团</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/openai-bans-cluster-russian-chatgpt-users-burke-institute-influence-campaign-cybersecurity/</link><description>OpenAI 声称，俄罗斯用户隐藏在 VPN 后面，推动与影响力行动相关的智库并在网上传播亲俄罗斯内容。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290946167-e1787852235645.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:54:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/openai-bans-cluster-russian-chatgpt-users-burke-institute-influence-campaign-cybersecurity/</guid></item></channel></rss>